g the partner sets are temporally disjoint.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 44322, "total_output_tokens": 3543, "total_tokens": 47865, "total_latency_ms": 52819, "llm_calls": 6, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}